{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-address-jbr-resort-emaar-properties-jbr","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":35,"crm_id":"4206","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"The Address JBR Resort","slug":"the-address-jbr-resort-emaar-properties-jbr","display_address":"Jumeirah Beach Residence (JBR)","building_type":["apartment","branded"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":7000000,"display_price":"7M","lattitude":25.0762475,"longitude":55.1333765,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Address Residences Jumeirah Resort + Spa (JBR) is a branded project by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar </a>Hospitality Group. Located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-beach-residence/\">Jumeirah Beach Residence</a>, it is a glittering spectacle rising above the lively promenades of Jumeirah Beach Walk. Developed by one of the region’s most prestigious hospitality brands, the landmark features two 77-floor towers soaring 310 metres high, offering 443 serviced apartments and 478 residential apartments. From <strong>one- to five-bedroom layouts</strong>, each apartment is designed with en-suite bedrooms, spacious living and dining areas, fully equipped kitchens, and balconies with panoramic views of the sea, Marina, or city skyline.</p><p>Residents enjoy a premium resort lifestyle with 100 metres of direct beach access, a magnificent rooftop infinity pool on level 77, and access to award-winning dining, wellness, and concierge services. The towers also include 217 hotel rooms and suites—ranging from deluxe rooms to a Presidential Suite—featuring in-room automation and cutting-edge amenities. Just steps from The Beach, Bluewaters Island, and Dubai Marina Walk, this prime location offers seamless access to the city’s most iconic attractions and business hubs. Address Jumeirah blends urban energy with beachfront serenity—ushering in a bold new era of luxury living in Dubai.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_9dd5067c87.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_9dd5067c87","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_c5c4cf7c24.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_c5c4cf7c24","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_fd789a69a5.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_fd789a69a5","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_c1d0322372.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_c1d0322372","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_42a8410322.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_42a8410322","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_31ad3562ca.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_31ad3562ca","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_8e1fa35305.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_8e1fa35305","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_b125644689.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_b125644689","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_4c4ebff188.jpg","hash":"The_Address_JBR_Resort_4c4ebff188","name":"The Address JBR Resort"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.