e_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>100 metres of pristine private beach access, offering uninterrupted views of the Arabian Gulf and a seamless connection to Dubai’s premier coastal lifestyle.</li><li>Iconic twin towers soaring 310 metres over 77 floors, making it one of Dubai Marina’s most recognisable architectural landmarks.</li><li>Stunning rooftop infinity pool on level 77, providing an elevated resort experience with breathtaking 360-degree views of the sea and city skyline.</li><li>Choice of fully furnished 1- to 5-bedroom serviced apartments, designed with en-suite bedrooms, open living areas, and expansive balconies.</li><li>State-of-the-art smart home technology, paired with premium materials, branded fittings, and interiors inspired by the elegance of Italian coastal living.</li><li>Signature dining concepts, luxury spa, and holistic wellness facilities, delivering award-winning hospitality and lifestyle experiences for residents and guests.</li><li>Unbeatable location with direct access to The Beach, JBR Walk, and Dubai Marina, placing world</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1467,"cta":{"id":2244,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_375874e8af.jpg","hash":"Location_375874e8af","name":"Location"},"style":null,"title":"Iconically Located. Exceptionally Connected, Where the Marina Meets the Shoreline","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Ideally positioned at the edge of Jumeirah Beach Residences in Dubai Marina, Address Residences Jumeirah Resort + Spa enjoys a prime beachfront location with direct access to Sheikh Zayed Road. This striking two-tower development places residents within moments of Dubai’s most iconic attractions, i