room: 1,181 – 2,021 sq. ft.</strong><br><strong>• 3-Bedroom: 1,908 – 1,973 sq. ft.</strong><br><strong>• 4-Bedroom: 3,128 – 3,641 sq. ft.</strong><br><strong>• 5-Bedroom: 5,081 sq. ft.</strong></p><p>Each unit is thoughtfully designed to maximize space, natural light, and views of the Arabian Gulf or Dubai Marina.</p>","question":"What are the available floor plan sizes at The Address Residences JBR?"},{"id":6053,"answer":"<p>The Address Residences Jumeirah Resort + Spa is a ready-to-move-in development, making it ideal for end-users and investors seeking immediate returns.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is this a ready property or off-plan?"},{"id":6054,"answer":"<p>It is the final beachfront plot in JBR, with iconic twin towers rising 310 metres, offering 100m of private beach access, a skybridge infinity pool, and top-tier amenities.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes this project a unique investment opportunity?"},{"id":6055,"answer":"<p>Apartments start from AED 1.5 million with a very convenient payment plan, including just a 10% down payment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the starting price and payment plan?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_3c582201aa.jpg","src_cftle":"i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_3c582201aa.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/The_Address_JBR_Resort_3c582201aa.webp","format":"webp","transform":"744x","created_at":"2025-04-03 08:01:54.387","updated_at":"2025-04-03 08:29:01.330"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/The_Address_JBR_Resort_3c582201aa.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2025-04-03 08:29:01.330","updated_at":"2025-04-03 08:29:01.330"}]},{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Address_JBR_Resort_31ad35